* bjt.lib -- 双极型晶体管模型库
*
* S9013（NPN，TO-92，ICM = 500 mA，VCEO = 25 V，PC = 625 mW）
*   来源：本项目按数据手册自行拟合，未复制任何厂商 SPICE 模型文件。
*   拟合目标（S9013 数据手册，25 °C）：
*     hFE 测试条件 VCE = 1 V、IC = 50 mA；分档 D/E/F/G/H/I = 64~202，
*     本模型取 H 档典型值 hFE ≈ 160（实训箱常用档）。
*     VCE(sat) ≤ 0.6 V @ IC = 500 mA / IB = 50 mA；fT ≈ 150 MHz；Cob ≈ 6 pF。
*   参数只取 ngspice 内置 Gummel-Poon 模型（NPN, level 1）的标准参数。
*   许可证：随本项目发布，可自由再分发（项目自有内容）。
*
.model S9013 NPN(IS=3e-14 BF=175 NF=1 VAF=100 IKF=1.2 ISE=1e-14 NE=1.5 BR=8 NR=1 VAR=20
+ IKR=0.2 RB=10 RE=0.2 RC=0.5 CJE=25e-12 VJE=0.75 MJE=0.33 CJC=8e-12 VJC=0.75 MJC=0.33
+ TF=0.9e-9 TR=50e-9 XTB=1.5 EG=1.11 XTI=3)

* NPN_3DG6_EST -- independently authored M0 teaching estimate, NOT a vendor model.
*   Intended board: mod-analog-amp, docs/原型选型说明.md section 5.3.
*   BF=60 is the prototype's estimated forward gain, not a measured 3DG6 grade.
*   IS=5e-15 A and NF=1 are chosen to give approximately 0.7 V VBE at a few mA
*   at 27 C. BR=2 and NR=1 are modelling assumptions for qualitative saturation.
*   Junction capacitances/potentials and transit times below are M0 estimates;
*   no 3DG6 datasheet capacitance, fT, breakdown or temperature fit is claimed.
*   Early effect and high-injection roll-off are omitted (ngspice defaults).
*   Therefore output resistance is dominated by the board's RC, not a claimed
*   device output characteristic. Use the active region for Au/Ri/Ro only.
*   This model is separate from S9013; no S9013 parameter set was renamed.
*   License: project-owned content, freely redistributable with this project.
*
.model NPN_3DG6_EST NPN(IS=5e-15 BF=60 NF=1 BR=2 NR=1 TNOM=27
+ CJE=12p VJE=0.7 MJE=0.33 CJC=5p VJC=0.7 MJC=0.33 TF=2n TR=20n)
